// File: zannastudio/src/commands/edit_commands.zia
// Purpose: Implement core editing, navigation, selection, and refactor commands.
// Key invariants:
//   - Commands operate on the focused editor and active document together.
//   - Failed cross-file navigation is never presented as successful.
// Ownership/Lifetime:
//   - Command handlers borrow shell, editor, document, and index controllers.
// Links: zannastudio/src/editor/editor_engine.zia,
//        zannastudio/src/services/locations.zia
//
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//

